{"articleNo":"175276","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=175276&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[K-RC교육원] 2017-2학기 푸름·오름관 입사자 생활관비 납부 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.07.05","hit":"5267","attachments":[{"name":"2017-2학기+푸름,오름관+입사자+생활관비+납부+안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=175276&attachNo=77671"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2017학년도 2학기 푸름,오름관 입사자 생활관비 납부기간을 안내드립니다. 자세한 내용은 첨부파일을 확인해주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">1.&nbsp;납부기간 : 2017. 7. 18.(화) 10:00 ~ 7. 21.(금) 은행 마감시간까지</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">납부기간 내 미납부자는 별도의 통보 없이 탈락 처리함</span></p>&nbsp;&nbsp; <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2. 납부고지서 출력 : 원스톱-학생지원-생활관-생활관신청결과/고지서 출력</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(2017. 7. 18.(화) 10시 이후 출력가능)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">3. 납부방법</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; 가. 고지서 지참하여 창구납부(농협만 가능)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; 나. 가상계좌 납부(전국은행) : 인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹, ATM 이용</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4. 납부확인</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; 가. 은행 : 실시간</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; 나. 학교 : <strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">납부 다음날 10:00 이후</font>&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">원스톱 - 학생지원- 생활관 - 생활관 신청결과/고지서</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 출력 에서 확인 가능</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></font></p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2017. 7. 5.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">K-RC교육원장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
